          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha Ibanga eli lya Sioni Omukama w'amahe alikoleraho amahanga gona obugenyi, obugenyi bw'edivai enungi muno n'ebyakulya ebishaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha niho alihiraho amahanga gona obujune. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orufu alirumaraho limoi limoi. Wenene Omukama Ruhanga aliragaza abantu bona amalira, n'abantube abaihyeho enshoni ezamanyikire omu nsi zona; Omukama wenene ekigambo eki n'iwe akigambire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kir'ekyo abantu tuligamba bati, “Leba ichwe ogu n'iwe aba Ruhanga waitu, n'iwe tutura tulindiliire kuturokora. Omukama niw'ogu; tutura tumulindiliire; tushemelerwe tushanduke aha rw'okuba yaturokora.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama alyemera Eibanga lya Sioni, Moabu abe n'iwe alibatilirwa nk'okwo ente zilibatilira ekyaliire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamoabu tulimukya emikono nk'atulikugonza kuziha, kyonkai Ruhanga alibafutika bagwe emikono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga alisinjagulikya eboma za Moabu n'oburai bwazo, zisasanuke nk'echuchu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
